## Session 3 summary

**Criteria not met — marker not written.** Major ground gained:

1. **ROOT FIXED (proven at line level):** the cluster-wide shutdown family (urandom over dir block0 daddr 0x78 → CRC error 74, runs 12/13/15) = `P22-SFTORN-SKIP` in `xfs_iflush` consumed `ili_fields` via `flush_out` without writing, silently discarding the rm-phase dir contraction whose block frees were already durable → reload resurrected a map of freed blocks → blk15 double-allocated to file data. Fix: `-EAGAIN` keep-dirty retry (xfs_inode.c + xfs_iflush_cluster skip handling), build `780517DA` deployed. Verified: `PW-IFLUSH fmt=1` writes now occur; **zero shutdowns across runs 16/17/18** (previously dead by r=2-7); runs now reach 17-19 rounds with 15-17 clean.

2. **Instrumentation now in-tree** (all default-off): `mxfs.watch_daddr` (PW-SLOT dinode decode, PW-IWR partial-writer masks, PW-WDONE completions), `mxfs.watch_ino` (PW-IFLUSH/IABORT/RELFENCE/ADOPT/BLOCK2SF/LEAF2BLOCK lifecycle), and DLM `P-LKTIMEOUT-HOLDER/-REMOTE` timeout holder dumps.

